{"seq":2,"slug":"risk-tier-pricing-fee","title":"按信用的费率/保证金差异化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/risk-tier-pricing-fee","wordCount":2175,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"按信用的费率-保证金差异化\">按信用的费率/保证金差异化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把信用等级映射到费率与保证金，本质上是一次<strong>风险定价</strong>：平台为不同信用水平的商家设定不同的资金条件，使风险与价格匹配。这与保险精算、消费信贷的核心逻辑相同——低风险客户享受优惠条件，高风险客户承担更高成本，整体资金池才能平衡。</p>\n<p>差异化的前提是<strong>价格必须能覆盖成本</strong>。用一个等式表述：某等级商家的所有成本（资金成本 + 期望坏账 + 服务成本 + 支付通道费）应当由该等级收取的费用覆盖。若金牌商家的费率定得过低，平台会用其他等级的收入去补贴它，长期必然失衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[商家信用等级] --&gt; B[风险参数估计&lt;br/&gt;违约概率/损失率]&#10;  B --&gt; C[成本模型]&#10;  C --&gt; D1[资金成本]&#10;  C --&gt; D2[期望坏账]&#10;  C --&gt; D3[服务成本]&#10;  D1 --&gt; E[目标费率/保证金]&#10;  D2 --&gt; E&#10;  D3 --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F{与现行价目表对比}&#10;  F --&gt;|差异过大| G[限制单次调整幅度]&#10;  F --&gt;|合理| H[应用新价目]&#10;  G --&gt; H&#10;  H --&gt; I[通知与生效]\">graph TD\n  A[商家信用等级] --&gt; B[风险参数估计&lt;br/&gt;违约概率/损失率]\n  B --&gt; C[成本模型]\n  C --&gt; D1[资金成本]\n  C --&gt; D2[期望坏账]\n  C --&gt; D3[服务成本]\n  D1 --&gt; E[目标费率/保证金]\n  D2 --&gt; E\n  D3 --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F{与现行价目表对比}\n  F --&gt;|差异过大| G[限制单次调整幅度]\n  F --&gt;|合理| H[应用新价目]\n  G --&gt; H\n  H --&gt; I[通知与生效]</pre><p>消费信用领域提供了可借鉴的监管形态：在美国，基于消费者报告给出更差条件时必须发<strong>风险定价通知</strong>或提供信用分数披露作为替代（见 <a href=\"https://www.consumerfinance.gov/rules-policy/regulations/1022/subpart-h/\">CFPB, 12 CFR Part 1022 Subpart H</a>）。平台对商家的差异化定价在结构上类似——<strong>给更差条件的决定需要说明并给异议渠道</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>等级</th>\n<th>费率系数（示意）</th>\n<th>保证金系数</th>\n<th>账期</th>\n<th>综合资金条件</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>钻石</td>\n<td>0.85</td>\n<td>0.0</td>\n<td>T+15</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>金牌</td>\n<td>0.95</td>\n<td>0.3</td>\n<td>T+15</td>\n<td>优</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>银牌</td>\n<td>1.00</td>\n<td>1.0</td>\n<td>T+7</td>\n<td>基准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>铜牌</td>\n<td>1.10</td>\n<td>1.5</td>\n<td>T+7</td>\n<td>偏紧</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>观察</td>\n<td>1.20</td>\n<td>2.0</td>\n<td>T+3</td>\n<td>最紧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"风险参数的估计\">风险参数的估计</h2><h3 id=\"违约概率从等级内历史数据估计\">违约概率从等级内历史数据估计</h3><p>每一档的风险参数（违约概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、违约损失率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>）应当从该档的历史表现估计，而不是主观设定。估计时要注意<strong>样本量差异</strong>：钻石档商家数少，直接用其历史违约率会非常不稳定（可能为 0，也可能是 1 单坏账造成的极端值）。这里需要收缩估计，方法与 <a href=\"../credit-model-dimension/multi-market-credit-agg\">多市场/多店铺信用聚合</a> 中的 Beta-Binomial 一致。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>tier</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>tier</mtext></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>tier</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_{\\text{tier}} = \\frac{\\alpha + y_{\\text{tier}}}{\\alpha + \\beta + n_{\\text{tier}}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1408em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>y</mi><mtext>tier</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y_{\\text{tier}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该档违约数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>tier</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_{\\text{tier}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">tier</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该档交易笔数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>β</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha, \\beta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span></span></span></span></span> 是全平台先验。这样钻石档即使历史零违约，也不会得出「零风险、零成本」的错误结论。</p>\n<h3 id=\"相关但不能冗余-费率与保证金的分工\">相关但不能冗余：费率与保证金的分工</h3><p>费率作用于<strong>每一笔交易的收入</strong>，保证金作用于<strong>平台的风险敞口</strong>。二者的最优组合取决于平台的风险偏好：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>费率派</strong>：提高费率即可覆盖风险，保证金保持低位。优点是简单、无资金占用摩擦；缺点是高风险商家可以用高价买通道，风险敞口仍由平台承担。</li>\n<li><strong>保证金派</strong>：用保证金吸收损失，费率保持低位。优点是有抵押、风险实质转移；缺点是占用商家资金，影响其经营意愿。</li>\n<li><strong>混合</strong>：低风险用费率优惠，高风险用保证金约束。这是最常用方案，也是上表的形态。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>作用点</th>\n<th>风险转移程度</th>\n<th>商家资金占用</th>\n<th>适合的风险层级</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>费率上浮</td>\n<td>每笔收入</td>\n<td>低（仅间接）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>所有层级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>保证金</td>\n<td>敞口抵押</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中高风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账期缩短</td>\n<td>敞口时长</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>中高风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结算冻结/预留金</td>\n<td>即时敞口</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>高风险与观察期</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"费率调整的锚点-不能用绝对费率-要用相对系数\">费率调整的锚点：不能用绝对费率，要用相对系数</h3><p>对外公示的价目表通常是绝对费率（如 3.5%），但等级差异化应当实现为<strong>相对基准的系数</strong>。原因是支付通道成本、市场税费、品类基准费率都会变化，用系数表达可以让所有等级同步跟随基准变化，只需维护一张系数表。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>rate</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tier</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>category</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>base</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>category</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{rate}(\\text{tier}, \\text{category}) = \\text{base}(\\text{category}) \\times \\gamma(\\text{tier})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rate</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">base</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">category</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"调整的边界与护栏\">调整的边界与护栏</h2><h3 id=\"单次调整幅度要受限\">单次调整幅度要受限</h3><p>等级变更一次可能带来费率从 1.20 降到 0.95（观察期到金牌），幅度 21%。若一次性应用，商家的成本结构会剧烈变化，且可能被套利——在活动期刷分升级、享受低费率后退化。因此需要<strong>单期调整上限</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>γ</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>clamp</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>γ</mi><mtext>target</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>γ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma_{t+1} = \\text{clamp}\\left(\\gamma_{\\text{target}},\\ \\gamma_t - \\delta_{\\max},\\ \\gamma_t + \\delta_{\\max}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">clamp</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">target</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0556em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 取 5%–10% 量级。这样从观察期到金牌需要数个结算周期才能走完，期间商家必须持续保持良好表现，套利动机被削弱。</p>\n<h3 id=\"护栏-不能让差异化变成排斥\">护栏：不能让差异化变成排斥</h3><p>差异化定价有一个伦理与合规边界：<strong>不能因为等级低就把商家排除在平台基本服务之外</strong>。基础功能（上架、收款、客服）必须对所有等级开放，差异化只作用于<strong>增量权益</strong>（更好的位置、更长的账期、更低的价格）。</p>\n<p>这个边界在欧盟语境下有明确依据。DSA 要求平台对商家的限制决定给出理由并提供申诉路径（见 <a href=\"https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/digital-services-act-package\">Digital Services Act: 平台义务</a>）。若差异化定价被认定为「限制服务」，就必须走说明与申诉流程。因此实现上，费率/保证金调整应当与等级变更通知合并发出，包含依据与异议入口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>护栏</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>违反后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础服务不设门槛</td>\n<td>上架/收款/客服对所有等级开放</td>\n<td>违反平台中立性，监管风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调整幅度上限</td>\n<td>单期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 变化 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\leq \\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>商家成本冲击、套利</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前通知期</td>\n<td>降级定价调整提前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 14 天</td>\n<td>现金流断裂投诉</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>说明义务</td>\n<td>通知含依据维度与异议入口</td>\n<td>DSA 合规风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上限封顶</td>\n<td>最高费率系数封顶（如 1.25）</td>\n<td>高风险商家被迫退出，治理目标落空</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"实现-价目表与生效时间\">实现：价目表与生效时间</h2><h3 id=\"价目表要按时间版本化\">价目表要按时间版本化</h3><p>费率与保证金是<strong>合同条款</strong>，必须有明确生效区间。用带 <code>effective_from/effective_to</code> 的价目表，配合商家维度的生效记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE pricing_scheme (&#10;  scheme_id      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  tier_code      TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  category_code  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_multiplier NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  deposit_multiplier NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  payment_term_days SMALLINT  NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_from TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  effective_to   TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (scheme_id, tier_code, category_code)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE merchant_pricing_state (&#10;  entity_id      BIGINT      NOT NULL,&#10;  category_code  TEXT        NOT NULL,&#10;  rate_multiplier NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  deposit_multiplier NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  applied_at     TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  target_multiplier NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  clamp_step     NUMERIC(6,4) NOT NULL DEFAULT 0.05,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (entity_id, category_code)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pricing_scheme</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  scheme_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_code      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deposit_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  payment_term_days </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SMALLINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_from </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  effective_to   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (scheme_id, tier_code, category_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> merchant_pricing_state</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  entity_id      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  category_code  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rate_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deposit_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  applied_at     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  target_multiplier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  clamp_step     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">6</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">05</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (entity_id, category_code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>rate_multiplier</code> 与 <code>target_multiplier</code> 分开存是关键的：前者是当前实际生效值，后者是本轮算出的目标值。每次结算周期按 <code>clamp_step</code> 把前者向后者推进一格，这样单期幅度上限在存储层就被强制，不依赖应用层记得做限制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"结算时按当时生效值计算\">结算时按当时生效值计算</h3><p>费用计算必须读取<strong>交易发生时</strong>生效的系数，而不是当前系数。否则一次价目调整会追溯影响已经发生的交易，导致对账不平。这条规则要求费用流水记录完整快照：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;settlement_id&quot;: &quot;st_778201&quot;,&#10;  &quot;entity_id&quot;: &quot;ent_90231&quot;,&#10;  &quot;order_id&quot;: &quot;o_5512890&quot;,&#10;  &quot;occurred_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-20T10:14:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;pricing_snapshot&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;rate_multiplier&quot;: 0.95,&#10;    &quot;deposit_multiplier&quot;: 0.3,&#10;    &quot;payment_term_days&quot;: 15,&#10;    &quot;scheme_id&quot;: &quot;ps-2026-09&quot;&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;amount&quot;: { &quot;gross&quot;: 1280.0, &quot;fee&quot;: 44.8, &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot; }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"settlement_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"st_778201\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"entity_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ent_90231\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"order_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"o_5512890\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"occurred_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-20T10:14:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"pricing_snapshot\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"rate_multiplier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"deposit_multiplier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"payment_term_days\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">15</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"scheme_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ps-2026-09\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"gross\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1280.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"fee\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">44.8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>pricing_snapshot</code> 内联进结算记录，而不是只存 <code>scheme_id</code> 引用——引用会在价目表修订后指向新内容，内联快照则永久可复现。这是资金类系统的通用原则：<strong>审计所需的金额相关字段必须内联固化</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"与账期资金流的衔接\">与账期资金流的衔接</h3><p>账期差异会直接改变平台的资金占用曲线。当大量商家从 T+7 升级到 T+15 时，平台需要预备更多营运资金。因此价目表的调整应当与资金计划联动——权益预算不只是「流量位够不够」，还包括「垫资规模够不够」。这部分属于资金与结算体系的范畴，信用分只提供风险参数输入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>信用等级到费率/保证金的映射是<strong>风险定价</strong>，价格必须覆盖该等级的资金成本、期望坏账与服务成本。</li>\n<li>每档风险参数从等级内历史数据用 Beta-Binomial 收缩估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = (\\alpha + y)/(\\alpha+\\beta+n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，避免小样本等级得出零风险的错误结论。</li>\n<li>费率与保证金分工不同：费率作用于每笔收入（低转移），保证金作用于敞口（高转移）；高风险层级应叠加账期缩短与结算预留。</li>\n<li>差异化实现为<strong>相对基准的系数</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>tier</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma(\\text{tier})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">tier</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 而非绝对费率，便于随基准同步调整。</li>\n<li>单期调整幅度受限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>δ</mi><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\delta_{\\max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mop mtight\"><span class=\"mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（5%–10%），从观察期到金牌需多个结算周期，削弱刷分套利动机。</li>\n<li>护栏：基础服务不设门槛、调整幅度上限、提前通知期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span></span></span></span></span> 14 天、说明义务、费率系数封顶。</li>\n<li>价目表与商家定价状态都要版本化；<code>rate_multiplier</code> 与 <code>target_multiplier</code> 分离，使单期幅度上限在存储层被强制。</li>\n<li>结算记录内联 <code>pricing_snapshot</code> 而非仅存引用，保证金额可永久复现；账期差异需与垫资计划联动。新商家的初始定价与冷启动见 <a href=\"new-merchant-coldstart\">新商家冷启动与初始信用</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"按信用的费率/保证金差异化","id":"按信用的费率-保证金差异化"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"风险参数的估计","id":"风险参数的估计"},{"level":3,"text":"违约概率从等级内历史数据估计","id":"违约概率从等级内历史数据估计"},{"level":3,"text":"相关但不能冗余：费率与保证金的分工","id":"相关但不能冗余-费率与保证金的分工"},{"level":3,"text":"费率调整的锚点：不能用绝对费率，要用相对系数","id":"费率调整的锚点-不能用绝对费率-要用相对系数"},{"level":2,"text":"调整的边界与护栏","id":"调整的边界与护栏"},{"level":3,"text":"单次调整幅度要受限","id":"单次调整幅度要受限"},{"level":3,"text":"护栏：不能让差异化变成排斥","id":"护栏-不能让差异化变成排斥"},{"level":2,"text":"实现：价目表与生效时间","id":"实现-价目表与生效时间"},{"level":3,"text":"价目表要按时间版本化","id":"价目表要按时间版本化"},{"level":3,"text":"结算时按当时生效值计算","id":"结算时按当时生效值计算"},{"level":3,"text":"与账期资金流的衔接","id":"与账期资金流的衔接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"流量/账期/保证金/活动权益","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/traffic-payout-term-benefit"},"next":{"title":"新商家冷启动与初始信用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/merchant-operating-credit-score/credit-benefit-link/new-merchant-coldstart"}}